## Actual integration patch under review

The manifest writer's resolved feature test is:

```go
version := 2
if len(m.Gates) > 0 {
	version = 3
}
for _, stage := range m.Stages {
	if stage.RunnerWorkspace != "" || stage.Log != nil {
		version = 4
		break
	}
